  "details": "Hello, My name is Shiru and ive been playing this game for 8 years. Ive made many connections and friends via the platform but i cant help but wonder… Is it possible to add a “Private Profile” or “Disable Friend Requests” Option in the future? I know Streamer mode has the option to Automatically disable friend requests.. however i feel this is doesnt quite scratch the itch i have. This is something ive been thinking about for a while. I know you can just Decline a friend request, but what if i didnt want the notification in the first place? Discord has it, instagram has private accounts, aswell as facebook. All with the common ground of being a Social Platform. Below i have mocked up a simple design idea for what this Quality of life feature might look like.\n\nStay Amazing, Love you guys <3",
